Third-party notices
===================

The MIT license above covers my code. The repository and the npm package also
contain other people's work, which keeps its own license: the libraries
bundled into public/ (React, KaTeX, Mermaid, SmilesDrawer and what they bring
in) and the Bioicons illustrations in public/icons/. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
lists them with their full license texts; `npm run build` generates it from
the bundle, and it ships with the package. public/icons/CREDITS.md names the
author and license of every icon and is part of those notices.
